{"4246780": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Question Roulette", "steam_appid": 4246780, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you thrive under pressure? Speed is your primary key to victory. You must be quicker than your opponent to earn more points and defeat them. Hesitation will cost you the round - carelessness will cost you your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4246780/extras/9fc439dd8b467044b173043aa8269a0e.poster.avif?t=1788264169\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4246780/extras/9fc439dd8b467044b173043aa8269a0e.webm?t=1788264169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4246780/extras/9fc439dd8b467044b173043aa8269a0e.mp4?t=1788264169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4246780/extras/7f3cf0ea212718709aacff841528be3e.webp?t=1788264169\" width=331 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Over 1500 carefully composed questions await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4246780/extras/4684f83e6bd5d3ce5013eb23c8551cd9.webp?t=1788264169\" width=271 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Compete against four distinct AI opponents, each with a unique difficulty level. Rely on quick wits and a little bit of luck as the question generator jumps wildly between subjects. To advance, you must first beat the easier opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4246780/extras/b240429d5587179a01d08214502a34ce.webp?t=1788264169\" width=303 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Challenge a friend or play against a stranger in a duel where knowledge and composure determine victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4246780/extras/a0351c0b39b912638ae7ed40de58e7ae.webp?t=1788264169\" width=244 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">If you lose on points or die, you must restart your run from the beginning. Be quick and precise with your answers!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you thrive under pressure? Speed is your primary key to victory. You must be quicker than your opponent to earn more points and defeat them. Hesitation will cost you the round - carelessness will cost you your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4246780/extras/9fc439dd8b467044b173043aa8269a0e.poster.avif?t=1788264169\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://sha